for(s=0;s<3;++s){q=B.a1o[s]
o=null
l=q.b
o=l
i+=B.b.H(A.a([q.a,o],j),k)+"\n"}j=i+'Zigbee = IEEE 802.15.4 PHY; the 2.4 GHz channels 11-26 are global, the sub-GHz bands are region-restricted. The "common picks" list is a widely-repeated convention (CSA/vendor guidance varies), not a standards requirement. Source: CSA/Zigbee spec + IEEE 802.15.4.\n'
