B.b8m=new A.k8("travel-routers-explained","/tools/travel-routers-explained","Travel Routers, Explained","Travel Routers, Explained","How one small box joins the hotel Wi-Fi for you, and gives all your devices a network they already know.",B.fO,B.bsN,B.bUP)
