B.b8s=new A.k8("scales-and-ratios-explained","/tools/scales-and-ratios-explained","Scales and Ratios, Explained","Scales and Ratios, Explained","The tiny and huge numbers behind Wi-Fi, turned into things you can hold, see and picture.",B.a1b,B.bvi,B.bSl)
