B.bFd=new A.aE("7","Four things people get wrong",B.c91,null)
B.btG=new A.am("assets/lesson-figures/wifi-on-planes/fig-11.svg",760,330,"**Figure 11. Do the heavy lifting on the ground.** Left, on a fast connection before you board. Right, on the shared link in the air.",null)
B.ciK=s(["**Download before you board.** Movies, shows, music and maps. Don't count on streaming in the air.","**Pair your earbuds on the ground.** It's easier before the doors close.","**Finish big updates at home.** Let backups and app updates run while you're on a fast connection.","**Check the top of your screen.** After airplane mode, make sure cellular is off.","**Message instead of calling.** Apps like iMessage and WhatsApp get through. Plain texts need Wi-Fi Calling. Calls often aren't allowed."],t.s)
