B.bKs=new A.aS("Checked on 28 September 2026. Airline Wi-Fi offers and phone menus change often.",!0)
B.c5s=s(['Apple, iPhone User Guide (iOS 27), __Choose iPhone settings for travel__ (airplane mode turns off Wi-Fi, Bluetooth and cellular at first; "it may still be on the next time")',"Apple 102554, __Use captive Wi-Fi networks__ (23 April 2026); Apple Platform Deployment, __Troubleshoot Wi-Fi connectivity on iPhone and iPad__ (captive.apple.com, DNS); Apple 102433, __Use Low Data Mode__ (15 September 2025)","Google Pixel Phone Help 12639358 (airplane mode remembers) and 2819583 (airplane mode settings); Pixel Phone Help 6183600 (sign in to a public network); Android Help 9654714 (treat as metered); Samsung Australia, Flight mode","47 CFR \xa7 22.925, FCC prohibition on airborne operation of cellular telephones (eCFR, read 28 September 2026)","FCC 13-157, Notice of Proposed Rulemaking, 12 December 2013 (why the rule was adopted); FCC FAQ on in-flight mobile services (2013); FCC 20-170, order terminating the proceeding, adopted 24 November 2020","14 CFR \xa7 91.21, Portable electronic devices; FAA Advisory Circular 91.21-1D (27 October 2017), section 9; FAA press release, 31 October 2013 (Bluetooth, Wi-Fi, low visibility, stowing, crew instructions)","Gogo, ATG network (coverage: contiguous US, parts of Canada and Alaska); ESA, types of orbits (35,786 km); SpaceX, Starlink latency (radio trip under 10 ms) and Starlink's orbital height, as used in __Starlink, Explained__","Keith Parsons, packet capture from his iPhone on a transatlantic flight, 20 September 2026 (31 ping replies from 1.1.1.1: fastest 614 ms, median 659 ms; captive.apple.com requests redirected to the airline's sign-in page)"],t.s)
