B.bA7=new A.ce("A fast internet plan covers my cameras.","Cameras send. The upload number is the one that counts, and it's usually much smaller.")
B.bAQ=new A.ce("One bar at the front door is fine.","A camera that barely hears the box sends slowly, may blur its own video, and slows the Wi-Fi for everyone.")
B.bAZ=new A.ce('A "wired" doorbell sends its video over the wire.',"In most homes the wire only powers it. The video still goes out by Wi-Fi.")
B.bAW=new A.ce("The default password is fine on my own network.","Change it. The first rule for any camera is its own password.")
B.bB7=new A.ce("Cloud recording is the only option.","Memory cards and home recorders keep video in your house.")
B.c9E=s([B.jD,B.brW,B.bA7,B.bAQ,B.bAZ,B.bAW,B.bB7],t.X)
B.bCK=new A.aE("11","Five things people get wrong",B.c9E,null)
B.byu=new A.b3("Half an hour, one camera at a time. Start with the one at your door.")
B.c9W=s(["Look up each camera's upload on its maker's help page, and add them up.","In the free WLAN Pros Toolbox, tap Network Quality and read the upload row. Compare."],t.s)
B.bHg=new A.i_("Check the upload",null,B.c9W,null)
B.bQC=s(["Open the camera's app and find its signal reading, with the door shut.","If it's weak, work through the fixes in step 4."],t.s)
B.bHv=new A.i_("Check the signal where it hangs",null,B.bQC,null)
B.bO_=s(["Its own password, two-step sign-in and automatic updates on every camera.","Baby monitor and cord at least 1 m (3 feet) from the crib."],t.s)
B.bHl=new A.i_("Lock it down",null,B.bO_,null)
