B.ceJ=s(['FCC, "Jammer Enforcement," updated September 2026: fcc.gov/general/jammer-enforcement','FTC Consumer Advice, "How To Secure Your Home Security Cameras," February 2023: consumer.ftc.gov/articles/how-secure-your-home-security-cameras','FTC Consumer Advice, "Securing Your Internet-Connected Devices at Home," August 2022: consumer.ftc.gov/articles/securing-your-internet-connected-devices-home','Google Nest Help, "Learn about internet bandwidth & speed requirements for Nest cameras": support.google.com/googlenest/answer/9245832','US Consumer Product Safety Commission, OnSafety, "Baby Monitor Cords: 3 Feet from Baby," 11 July 2012: onsafety.cpsc.gov','Police warnings, as reported: PCWorld, "Burglars are jamming Wi-Fi security cameras," 12 November 2024 (LAPD Wilshire Division, 2024); NBC Los Angeles, 17 March 2025 (LAPD Chief Jim McDonnell)',"Keith Parsons, __Fix Your Own Wi-Fi__ (WLAN Pros, in preparation, 2026), chapter 3"],t.s)
B.bCi=new A.js(B.ceJ)
B.boa=new A.bC(B.ak,"About this guide","Written for people who aren't technical and want their cameras to work when it matters. The figures come from one maker's help page because it publishes per-camera upload numbers; they're one maker's numbers, not a rating, and no maker had a part in this guide. The guide is independent and isn't affiliated with any camera maker, provider or carrier.",null,null,B.r)
