B.bnz=new A.bC(B.ak,"About this guide","Google, Ofcom, the MoCA Alliance and the Wi-Fi Alliance are cited from their own published pages; none of them had a part in this guide, and it is not an endorsement. The guide is independent and isn't affiliated with any maker or provider.",null,null,B.r)
