B.b8H=new A.k8("captive-portals-explained","/tools/captive-portals-explained","Captive Portals, Explained","Captive Portals, Explained","What that Wi-Fi sign-in page is, why it shows up, and what to do when it doesn't.",B.fO,B.btn,B.c4T)
