B.b8l=new A.k8("wifi-and-health-explained","/tools/wifi-and-health-explained","Wi-Fi and Your Health, Explained","Wi-Fi and Your Health, Explained","How much power Wi-Fi sends, how fast it fades, and what health agencies say about it.",B.ccz,B.buZ,B.ckT)
