B.ckK=s(["**Step outside, or stand by a window.** GPS finds you fastest under open sky.","**Keep your phone where it can see the sky.** In a car, a dash mount beats a cup holder or a pocket.","**Download maps before you travel.** Then saved areas work with no signal.","**Give it a moment in a city.** If the dot jumps around, wait a few seconds or walk to a wider street.","**Check which apps can see your location.** Turn it off for any app that doesn't need it."],t.s)
