B.bo0=new A.bC(B.ak,"About this guide","Written for people who aren't technical and want to know whether the box on the shelf is still safe to use. It names no router maker or model on purpose: the question that matters is whether a router still gets fixes, and that's true of every brand. It isn't legal advice. The guide is independent and isn't affiliated with any maker or provider.",null,null,B.r)
