B.b8r=new A.k8("router-too-old-explained","/tools/router-too-old-explained","Is Your Router Too Old?","Is Your Router Too Old?","How to tell in five minutes whether your router still gets security fixes, and what to do if it doesn't.",B.fO,B.brD,B.c9A)
