B.bAu=new A.ce("Airplane mode is the only way to avoid roaming charges.","Turning off Data Roaming stops data. A travel plan can carry your data. Airplane mode is just the bluntest switch.")
B.bB8=new A.ce("Data Roaming is off, so I can't be charged.","Calls and texts still work on that line. Answering a call can start a daily fee.")
B.bAf=new A.ce("The hotel has Wi-Fi, so I don't need data.","You need maps and ride apps between Wi-Fi spots. And your bank's security code goes to your home number.")
