B.c6m=s(["File the airline's lost-baggage report first.","{{Find My}} \u203a {{Items}} \u203a tap the tag \u203a {{Share Item Location}}.","Paste the link into the airline's form, or send it to the agent.","You can see who opened the link, and stop sharing from the same screen.","Keep at least one of your Apple devices online, or the link stops updating.","The link can show your phone number or email to the people you send it to."],t.s)
