B.bA8=new A.ce("Unlimited data means unlimited hotspot data.","Many plans treat hotspot data on its own. Some limit it or charge extra. Check your plan.")
B.bBa=new A.ce("A hotspot and a travel router are the same thing.","A hotspot brings its own internet, by cell. A travel router shares internet that is already there.")
B.bAn=new A.ce("It's fine to leave it on all day.","It drains the battery, and your devices may join it again and use data. Turn it off when you're done.")
