B.bQn=s(["**Put it near a window,** out in the open. Not in a bag or a hot car.","**Watch the cell bars** on the hotspot, not the Wi-Fi bars on your laptop.","**Plug it in** if you'll use it for a long time.","**Use a strong password.** Never pick no password.","**Turn on data saver** on the laptop or tablet that joins it.","**Check your plan** before a big download, like a movie or a system update.","**Turn it off when you're done.**"],t.s)
