B.b8E=new A.k8("devices-to-internet-explained","/tools/devices-to-internet-explained",u.B,u.B,"Wi-Fi and cellular are ways to reach the internet. They are not the internet. Follow the trip one hop at a time, and learn which hop to blame when something is slow.",B.c7f,B.bsu,B.c3_)
