B.bsP=new A.am("assets/lesson-figures/smart-home-radios/fig-07.svg",720,280,"**Figure 7. A Thread mesh.** Plugged-in devices relay for each other. If one goes offline, a message takes another path. The border router is the doorway to the rest of your home.",null)
