B.buT=new A.am("assets/lesson-figures/smart-home-radios/fig-08.svg",760,382,"**Figure 8. Where the border router lives.** Here it's inside a smart speaker. Thread gadgets pass their messages to it, and it hands them to your Wi-Fi router.",null)
