B.bzp=new A.b3("Two border routers are better than one. If one loses power, the other keeps the doorway open.")
B.bvg=new A.am("assets/lesson-figures/smart-home-radios/fig-09.svg",720,230,"**Figure 9. Before and after the update.** Left: older border routers each built their own network. Right: updated ones share one network, so either can be the doorway.",null)
B.bKS=new A.aS("Older border routers from different brands didn't always share. A recent Thread update fixed that. Many border routers get it through normal software updates.",!1)
B.bJ4=new A.aS("You don't need a border router from the same brand as your devices. They pass messages along without translating them.",!1)
