B.bqU=new A.am("assets/lesson-figures/satellite-texting/cover.svg",640,366,null,null)
B.byK=new A.b3("Many newer phones can send a text through a satellite. It works when there's no cell signal and no Wi-Fi. It works outdoors, it's slow, and it's for short messages.")
B.bI8=new A.aS("This guide answers three questions. What is satellite texting? Why does it matter to you? And what should you do before you head somewhere with no signal?",!1)
B.bow=new A.bC(B.ak,"A word on the words","Your **carrier** is your phone company. **SOS** means a call for help. In this guide, **911** means the emergency number where you are.",null,null,B.r)
B.c6f=s([B.byK,B.bI8,B.bow],t.X)
B.bGv=new A.aE("1","The short answer",B.c6f,null)
B.bwP=new A.b3("A normal text goes to a cell tower close by. A satellite text goes up to a satellite first. Then it comes back down to Earth.")
B.bs3=new A.am("assets/lesson-figures/satellite-texting/fig-01.svg",640,534,"**Figure 1. One text, up and back down.** The green legs are the trip through the air: the slow, fragile part. Not to scale.",null)
B.bKZ=new A.aS("The satellite is far away, and your phone's antenna is tiny. So the signal that gets there is faint, like a whisper across a stadium.",!1)
B.bJp=new A.aS("To get through, the phone sends a few words at a time. That's why a text can take a while.",!1)
B.bvy=new A.am("assets/lesson-figures/satellite-texting/fig-02.svg",640,534,"**Figure 2. A long way for a faint signal.** The message goes up in small pieces, one after another. Not to scale.",null)
B.bXA=s([B.bwP,B.bs3,B.bKZ,B.bJp,B.bvy],t.X)
B.bGt=new A.aE("2","How a text reaches a satellite",B.bXA,null)
B.byF=new A.b3("Satellite texting works outdoors, with a clear view of the sky. Anything overhead gets in the way.")
B.bsz=new A.am("assets/lesson-figures/satellite-texting/fig-03.svg",640,518,"**Figure 3. What's between you and the sky.** Open sky is best. Trees slow it down. Buildings and canyons can stop it.",null)
B.bK1=new A.aS("**Trees slow it down.** Under leaves, a text can take over a minute.",!1)
B.bHX=new A.aS("**Buildings block it.** Step outside before you try.",!1)
B.bIm=new A.aS("**The horizon matters too.** The satellite may be low in the sky. A hill or a wall of trees on one side can hide it.",!1)
B.buJ=new A.am("assets/lesson-figures/satellite-texting/fig-04.svg",640,604,"**Figure 4. The sky from where you stand.** Many satellites move across the sky. When one drops behind a hill, your phone waits for the next one. Not to scale.",null)
B.bJd=new A.aS("**Far north, it may not work at all.** Parts of Alaska aren't covered.",!1)
B.ch8=s([B.byF,B.bsz,B.bK1,B.bHX,B.bIm,B.buJ,B.bJd],t.X)
B.bG3=new A.aE("3","It needs to see the sky",B.ch8,null)
B.bz1=new A.b3("Your phone tells you what to do. Follow the arrows on the screen.")
B.bt7=new A.am("assets/lesson-figures/satellite-texting/fig-05.svg",640,548,"**Figure 5. Hold it out in the open.** Left: what to do. Right: what loses the satellite.",null)
B.bIj=new A.aS("Some phones ask you to turn until you face the satellite. Others find it on their own. Either way, keep the phone in your hand, not in a pocket or a pack.",!1)
B.bIA=new A.aS("Once you're connected, stay where you are. Walking under trees or indoors can lose the satellite.",!1)
B.bwv=new A.ew("What you can send")
B.bJ2=new A.aS("Short texts get through best. Photos, video and calls mostly wait until you're back in coverage. Some phones can also share your location.",!1)
B.brz=new A.am("assets/lesson-figures/satellite-texting/fig-06.svg",640,338,"**Figure 6. Text first.** Left: what can go by satellite. Right: what waits.",null)
B.bZr=s([B.bz1,B.bt7,B.bIj,B.bIA,B.bwv,B.bJ2,B.brz],t.X)
B.bF7=new A.aE("4","Holding the phone, and waiting",B.bZr,null)
B.bx7=new A.b3("Satellite texting can reach help from places no cell tower covers. It can't reach help from everywhere, every time.")
B.bnE=new A.bC(B.fi,"Don't make satellite texting your only way to get help","It needs open sky, a phone that supports it, a charged battery and time. Under trees, indoors or in a canyon, it may not connect. Leave your route and your return time with someone at home.",null,null,B.r)
B.bsp=new A.am("assets/lesson-figures/satellite-texting/fig-07.svg",640,460,"**Figure 7. A backup, not a promise.** All four have to line up at once. Your plan with someone at home is the part that doesn't depend on the sky.",null)
B.bJa=new A.aS("**It can be slow, or not work.** Carriers say satellite texts, even to 911, may be delayed or may not go through.",!1)
B.bKQ=new A.aS("**Emergency alerts may not reach you.** Some satellite services don't pass along weather or safety alerts.",!1)
B.bL7=new A.aS("**Not every phone has it.** It depends on your phone, your carrier and the country you're in. Check with your carrier and your phone maker. This changes often.",!1)
