B.bG7=new A.aE("5","A backup, not a promise",B.bMY,null)
B.bwQ=new A.b3("Almost everything has to be done while you still have a signal.")
B.bsj=new A.am("assets/lesson-figures/satellite-texting/fig-08.svg",640,308,"**Figure 8. Do it all before you lose signal.** The numbers match the steps below.",null)
B.c_u=s(["**Ask your carrier** whether your phone and plan support satellite texting where you're going.","**Update your phone's software.**","**Set up your emergency contacts and medical details.** On an iPhone, they're in the Health app.","**Try the demo, outdoors.** The steps are below.","**Charge the phone,** and bring a battery pack on longer trips.","**Tell someone** where you're going and when you'll be back."],t.s)
