B.bBm=new A.ce("Satellite texting is like having a cell signal.","It's slow, and it's mostly text. Under open sky, a message can take half a minute.")
B.bAp=new A.ce("It works indoors or under trees.","It needs the sky. Trees slow it down. Buildings and canyons can block it.")
B.bA0=new A.ce("Every phone has it.","It depends on your phone, your carrier and where you are. Ask before you go.")
B.bB2=new A.ce("It's only for emergencies.","Emergency texts came first. Now some phones and carriers let you text family and friends too.")
