B.dEe=new A.An("Did it break at a roam? (display)",B.bQk,"The method is the part worth writing down. Filter to one rtp.ssrc, note the sequence numbers either side of the gap, then look at what the client did in between. A roam that costs 300 ms is audible. A roam that costs 50 ms is not. An RTP gap that lines up with a reassociation is a roaming problem wearing a VoIP costume.")
