B.aRq=new A.m_("EUI-48",'48-bit identifier (6 octets), 12 hex digits. Common forms: 00-1B-44-11-3A-B7 (hyphen), 00:1B:44:11:3A:B7 (colon), 001B.4411.3AB7 (Cisco dotted). The legacy term "MAC-48" is deprecated in favor of EUI-48.',"IEEE 802; RFC 5342 \xa72.1")
