B.aRk=new A.m_("EUI-48 to EUI-64","Insert FF-FF between the OUI (first 3 octets) and the device portion (last 3 octets).","IEEE 802")
B.aRg=new A.m_("Modified EUI-64 (IPv6)","Insert FF-FE (not FF-FF) in the middle AND invert the U/L bit. Used to derive an IPv6 interface identifier from an EUI-48.","RFC 4291 Appendix A")
B.aRn=new A.m_("Transmission bit order","Octets transmitted most-significant-octet first; within each octet, least-significant bit first (canonical / LSB-first on Ethernet). The first transmitted bit of the first octet is the I/G bit.","IEEE 802")
