B.d7I=new A.OA("Security Torx (pin-in Torx, TR)","A normal Torx star with a small post (pin) in the center; a solid Torx bit will not seat.","Torx security bit with a hole bored down the center to clear the pin (sized T10H-T40H). The most common tamper spec on commercial enclosures.")
