B.atb=new A.a1t("AA","14.50 mm x 50.50 mm","On every shelf. The lithium AA also carries the dimensional code FR14505, whose 14 and 505 groups agree with the datasheet: at least 14 mm across, 50.5 mm tall.","Energizer L91, Form L91GL1222.")
B.atc=new A.a1t("A","17.13 mm x 50.90 mm","In current production, inside packs rather than on shelves. FDK HR-AUE is a 1.2 V NiMH A cell whose 2700 mAh is a nameplate rating: a datasheet headline, not a capacity measured at a stated load. Saft LS17500 is a 3.6 V lithium thionyl chloride A cell. LS17500 is a Saft house code and not an IEC dimensional code, so do not read a size out of it: it disagrees with the measured can.","Saft LS17500, Doc 31029-2-0710.")
